# FastSora v1.2.8 - Supabase Login Integration

## Summary

Replaced HWID license system with Supabase email/password authentication.

---

## Changes Made

### 1. Main Process ([out/main/_index.js](file:///D:/sorabatchcreatevideo-1.1.0-setup/fastsora-1.2.8-setup/$PLUGINSDIR/app-64-extracted/resources/app-unpacked/out/main/_index.js))

- Added `@supabase/supabase-js` import
- Added Supabase config constants (user needs to update)
- Replaced [setupLicenseHandlers()](file:///D:/sorabatchcreatevideo-1.1.0-setup/fastsora-1.2.8-setup/$PLUGINSDIR/app-64-extracted/resources/app-unpacked/out/main/_index.js#4435-4506) with:
  - `license:login` - Email/password login via Supabase
  - `license:checkSession` - Check existing session
  - `license:logout` - Sign out

